 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Constant etale sheaves on a curve",
 "statement": "Let $C$ be a curve and let $n\\geq1$.\nThe *constant etale sheaf* $\\mathbf F_n$ on $C_{\\Et}$ is the\nsheaf $\\underline{\\mathbf Z/n\\mathbf Z}$ associated to the constant\npresheaf $U\\mapsto\\mathbf Z/n\\mathbf Z$ (see\n[def-weil-pbc-etale-sheaves]); its geometric stalks are\n$\\mathbf Z/n\\mathbf Z$.",
